=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Warning:}** __{p:Trust Magic} cannot be used in this BCNM, but the fight is targeted at level 75.__
* Approach {p:Naja Salaheem} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
* Examine {p:Imperial Whitegate} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (L-8/9) to receive the {@k} {k:Imperial missive}.
** The quest now appears under Aht Urhgan: Current Quests.
* Examine the **Audience Chamber** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} at (H-6).
* You must speak to representatives from the main nations, these can be done in any order.
** Speak to {p:Halver} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (I-9) to receive the {@k} {k:San d'Orian approval letter}.
** Speak to {n:Iron Eater} in {z:Metalworks} (J-8) to receive the {@k} {k:Bastokan approval letter}.
** Speak to {n:Kupipi} in {z:Heavens Tower} to receive the {@k} {k:Windurstian approval letter}.
* Return to the **Audience Chamber** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} at (H-6) for the {@k} {k:Jeunoan approval letter}.
* Examine Imperial Whitegate at Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) to receive the {@k} {k:present for Megomak|Present for Megomak}.
** To save time buy 3 {p:Slabs of Plumbago|Plumbago (Item)} from the AH or you can choose to farm them from Troll enemies in Mount Zhayolm or through mining.
* Examine the **Acid-eaten Door** in {z:Mount Zhayolm} at the northwest corner of (I-9) to receive the {@k} {k:Megomak's shopping list}.
** The door is past the **Gates of Halvung** near {p:Halvung Staging Point}, not the other one.
*** Requires a {@k}{k:Cast metal plate} to open the **Gates of Halvung**.
* Trade 3 {p:Slabs of Plumbago|Plumbago (Item)} to the Acid-eaten Door to receive the {@k} {k:lightning cell|Lightning cell}.
* Examine the **blank target** on the single dark lamp at the {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point} in {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins} (J-8/9) for a cutscene.
* Examine the {p:Runic Seal} in {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins} (I-8/9) to start the BCNM fight.
** In this fight, you will be against {p:Alexander|Alexander (Notorious Monster)}.
** Alexander can spawn up to three Alexander Images.
** At low HP, Alexander will use **Divine Judgment** dealing high damage to everyone in range.
* Upon defeating the BCNM you will receive the {@k}{k:Whisper of radiance}.
* Examine Imperial Whitegate at Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) for a cutscene.
* Speak to Naja Salaheem to choose your reward.

